!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Mock; medium containing human serum, RTX-SEC; medium containing 10 µg/mL rituximab and human serum (14 days), and RTX-REC; medium with 10 µg/mL rituximab increased to 25 µg/mL at day 16 and with repeated re-administration of human serum (21 days)
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Cells were kept at 0.3-1x106 cells/mL, cultured in RPMI 10% FBS and 1% P/S
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Cells were lysed and gDNA was extracted by precipitation  of proteins by NaCl (6M) and subsequent precipitation  of gDNA with isopropanol
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = A nested PCR approach was used to generate PCR amplicons with sufficient coverage of the lirary. PCR amplicons were processed by end repair, ligated to BGISEQ sequencer compatible adapters, generating DNB-based sequencing libraries without PCR amplification
